    {
      "id": 148,
      "start": 316.08,
      "end": 318.16,
      "text": "building RPA boards and automations and"
    },
    {
      "id": 149,
      "start": 318.16,
      "end": 320.4,
      "text": "stuff."
    },
    {
      "id": 150,
      "start": 320.4,
      "end": 324.08,
      "text": ">> So, we had different uh invoices coming"
