    {
      "id": 151,
      "start": 324.08,
      "end": 326.16,
      "text": "in from different vendors and we were"
    },
    {
      "id": 152,
      "start": 326.16,
      "end": 327.36,
      "text": "trying to build these automation"
    },
    {
      "id": 153,
      "start": 327.36,
      "end": 329.039,
      "text": "pipelines"
    },
    {
      "id": 154,
      "start": 329.039,
      "end": 331.44,
      "text": "uh and as as you can imagine like a"
    },
    {
      "id": 155,
